99                 will be registered in the toolkit to allow the agent to
100                 manage the long-term memory. If `static_control`, retrieving
101                 and recording will happen in the beginning and end of
102                 each reply respectively.
103             parallel_tool_calls (`bool`, defaults to `False`):
104                 When LLM generates multiple tool calls, whether to execute
