111                 retrieving from the knowledge base(s), e.g. rewrite "Who am I"
112                 to "{user's name}" to get more relevant documents. Only works
113                 when the knowledge base(s) is provided.
114             plan_notebook (`PlanNotebook | None`, optional):
115                 The plan notebook instance, allow the agent to finish the
116                 complex task by decomposing it into a sequence of subtasks.
117             print_hint_msg (`bool`, defaults to `False`):
118                 Whether to print the hint messages, including the reasoning
119                 hint from the plan notebook, the retrieved information from
